{"id":720748,"title":"结课测试｜来赴一场满分之约吧！","content":"<p>我们的课程已经结课了。非常感谢你一直以来的认真学习和支持！</p><p>为了帮你检验自己的学习效果，我特意给你准备了一套结课测试题（可以重复体验）。这套测试题是 20 单选题，考点都来自我们前面讲到的重要知识。点击下面按钮开始测试吧！  <a href=\"http://time.geekbang.org/quiz/intro?act_id=5626&exam_id=12406\"><img src=\"https://static001.geekbang.org/resource/image/28/a4/28d1be62669b4f3cc01c36466bf811a4.png?wh=1142*201\" alt=\"\"></a>   最后，我还给你准备了一份<a href=\"https://jinshuju.net/f/vaVtS4\">结课问卷</a>，希望你能花两三分钟填写一下，非常期待能听到你对这门课的反馈。</p>","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":404947,"user_name":"605772","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":3769559,"ip_address":"湖北","ucode":"6B87D229D69CCA","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1769412371,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100310001,"comment_content":"已完成测试","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":404946,"user_name":"605772","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":3769559,"ip_address":"湖北","ucode":"6B87D229D69CCA","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1769411129,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100310001,"comment_content":"已学习","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":401633,"user_name":"许俊","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1392872,"ip_address":"德国","ucode":"39406B94D93C3A","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/15/40/e8/661bec60.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1753061548,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100310001,"comment_content":"老师，问题卷第二题是不是答案有误，我程序运行了下，是1不是None。\ndef func(arg1=0, *arg2, **arg3):\n    print(f&quot;arg1:{arg1},arg2:{arg2},arg3:{arg3}&quot;)\nfunc(1, &quot;23&quot;, [4, 5], {6: 7, 8: 9}, d=0)\n结果：arg1:1,arg2:(&#39;23&#39;, [4, 5], {6: 7, 8: 9}),arg3:{&#39;d&#39;: 0}","like_count":0}]}